///////////////////////////////////////////////////////
//
//  Symbol Table usage
//
//  Construct           Named   Parent Constructs
//  ---------------------------------------------------
//  Global namespace    No      None
//
//  atomic              No      ALL - Global
//	block				No		ALL - Global
//  ctor                No      Class
//  do                  No      ALL - Global
//  dtor                No      Class
//  enum                Yes     ALL
//  for                 No      ALL - Global
//  function            No      ALL
//  if - else           No      ALL - Global
//  interface           Yes     ALL (base types then enclosing scope)
//  namespace           Yes     Global namespace
//                              Namespace
//  operator            No      ALL
//  pure function       No      ALL
//  select              No      ALL
//  switch              No      ALL - Global
//  try - catch         No      ALL - Global
//  type                Yes     ALL (base types then enclosing scope)
//  union               Yes     ALL (base types then enclosing scope)
//  where               No      ALL
//  while               No      ALL - Global


[x] Set current st to global
[x] Whenever new st is created, it becomes current with parent old current
[x] Whenever leaving st, parent becomes current

Construct handling

[x]	atomic              create symtbl
[x]	block				
[x]	try					
[x]	do					
[x]	dtor                

[x]	namespace           create symtbl with namespace name
[x]	interface           
[x]	enum                
[x]	type                
[x]	union               

[x]	ctor                create symtbl with parameters added
[x]	function            
[x]	operator            
[x]	catch         		
[x]	pure function

[x]	for                 create symtbl with variable def
[x]	if - else           
[x]	switch              
[x]	while               

Add definition to current symtbl

[x] function
[x] pure function
[x] operator
[x] ctor
[x] dtor

[x] alias

[x] namespace

[x] if
[x] while
[x] for
[x] switch
[x] catch parameter
[x] variable
[x] function parameter
[x] ctor parameter
[x] dtor scope
[x] pure function parameter
[x] operator parameter

[x] type
[x] interface
[x] union
[x] enum

[x] enum member

Expression lookup handling

[ ]	select              use symtbl of from collection
[ ]	where				use symtbl of LHS expr

